[{:adr/candidate-selection-7911 "'7911' (Travel agency activities) selected: scoped to booking and selling third-party travel products (flights, accommodation, transfers) as an intermediary, richly regulated ('Seller of Travel' statutes in California, Florida, Washington, Iowa and Hawaii requiring registration and often bonding/trust-account arrangements; ARC accreditation for US agencies issuing airline tickets, IATA accreditation internationally; the EU's Package Travel Directive (2015/2302) explicitly distinguishing retailer/intermediary liability from organizer liability). Distinct from every transport-CARRIER vertical (aviationops/5110, railops/4911, freightrailops/4912, ferryops/5011, and the marine-tanker/petroleum-fleet's own 5020): a travel agency books travel WITH those carriers, without operating any transport itself. Also distinct from the natural sibling '7912' (Tour operator activities, still :spec, untouched): a travel agent RETAILS third-party travel products bearing intermediary liability, while a tour operator DESIGNS/ASSEMBLES package tours under its own brand bearing organizer liability. grep -rli 'travel.agency|tour.operator|travel.booking|excursion' across the fleet returned completely empty. Governor keyword :travel-agency-governor grep-verified UNIQUE fleet-wide. Legacy placeholder :repo (gftdcojp/cloud-itonami-N7911) confirmed via direct GitHub API 404 check to never have actually existed", :adr/fresh-governor-no-collision-7911 "this blueprint's own :itonami.blueprint/governor keyword, :travel-agency-governor, is grep-verified UNIQUE fleet-wide", :adr/registry-field-replacement-7911 "the existing '7911' registry entry had its :repo, :business-id and :optional-technologies fields updated (:optional-technologies gains :optimization, matching itinerary/routing optimization needs), and its explicit :maturity :spec override REMOVED so maturity/maturity-of now auto-derive :blueprint from the real :repo presence", :adr/related ["2607104500-cloud-it